Create workspace

 


Create a virtual environment using the following command:
python3 -m venv ~/projects/SAP_GenAI/env --upgrade-deps
Activate the env virtual environment like this and make sure it is activated:
source ~/projects/SAP_GenAI/env/bin/activate
 
 


👉 Install the Generative AI Hub Python SDK and LangChain integration for SAP HANA Cloud plus all the other packages listed below using the following pip install commands.
--require-virtualenv        Allow pip to only run in a virtual environment; exit with an error otherwise.

pip install --require-virtualenv -U  "sap-ai-sdk-gen[all]" 'langchain-hana==0.2.2'
pip install --require-virtualenv sap-ai-sdk-gen[all]
pip install --require-virtualenv langchain-hana
pip install --require-virtualenv scipy
pip install --require-virtualenv pypdf wikipedia

pip install --require-virtualenv langchain-chroma

pip install --require-virtualenv bs4

pip install --require-virtualenv markdownify
